    "description": "Transforming the classic, equal-parts Last Word into a refreshing spritz, this recipe replaces gin and lengthens the drink with soda water. “It’s light, bright, and herbaceous, with a touch of sweetness from the cherry liqueur,” says Danny Webber, general manager at aperitivo bar Capri Club in LA’s Eagle Rock neighborhood. “It’s a great lighter cocktail for warm afternoons.”",
